+/* Peer lookup memory belongs to NSS after a successful CREATE submission.
+ * free() requires a proven non-submission, matching DELETE ACK or SOC reset.
+ * quarantine() transfers unresolved memory to this driver and prevents SOC
+ * interface reuse until HAL has halted that core and drained its IRQ/NAPI.
+ * These APIs are not for hardware ring descriptors or packet buffers.
+ */
